// Oathbound placeholder art, baked into assets/buildings/oathbound.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release -- --config assets-src/buildings/oathbound.ron --out assets/buildings/oathbound.pak`).
// Every source is a `repo:` file (Kenney Castle Kit and CDmir's Alien Bug, both CC0) following
// docs/16-art-sourcing.md, so the pack bakes on any host. Each entry is a stand-in: when the Meshy asset
// with the catalogue ID in the comment is made, only the `source` line changes (docs/39-oathbound.md,
// research catalogue 04). Names are exactly as in data/rosters/oathbound.ron; a building has `#1`..`#3`
// construction stages and the finished model under its own name, a gatehouse only `#3` and the finished one.
// Placeholders still to model (they draw as boxes or reuse nothing): see docs/39.
